        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "37-1. LEAVE OF ABSENCE FOR PERSONAL BUSINESS—Leave of absence for personal business may be granted by the Board of Education for such periods as the Board may decide, said period may not exceed one (1) year. Teachers on such leave may request extension of such leave for good and valid cause. Those to whom such leave is granted shall suffer loss of pay and must state, in writing, that they will not accept another position as administrator, supervisor or teacher during that period.",
